#: website/public/blog/reverse-engineering-models/index.html:801
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:blog/reverse-engineering-models/index.html"
msgid ""
"{ph0}TH09 temporary lifetimes:{ph1} the {ph2}earlier context review{ph3} and"
" {ph4}complete cold reconstruction{ph5}."
msgstr ""
"{ph0}TH09 عمر الكائن المؤقت:{ph1} تم التحقق من {ph2}مراجعة السياق "
"السابقة{ph3} و{ph4}إعادة البناء الكاملة من خلال إعادة تجميع نظيفة من "
"المصدر{ph5}."

#. {ph0}: <strong>
#. {ph1}: </strong>
#. {ph2}: <a
#. href="https://github.com/N0zoM1z0/th09/commit/f8d12d72aaf02212ee1b585a8f3f86d7ed000269"
