msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid ""
"The reference gives the agent a place to investigate, even though the "
"executable's original function names have been removed."
msgstr ""
"La referencia le da al agente un lugar para investigar, aunque se hayan "
"eliminado los nombres de funciones originales del ejecutable."

#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:338
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid "Read the checker and its two helpers"
msgstr "Lea el corrector y sus dos ayudantes"

#. {ph0}: <code>0x18</code>
#. {ph1}: <code>0x270</code>
#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:366
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid ""
"The first loop copies 36 character codes. The checking loop decodes a mask, "
"sums the selected codes and compares the result with a stored number. Its "
"{ph0}-byte steps across {ph1} bytes give 26 masks."
msgstr ""
"El primer bucle copia códigos de 36 caracteres. El bucle de comprobación "
"decodifica una máscara, suma los códigos seleccionados y compara el "
"resultado con un número almacenado. Su {ph0}- pasos de bytes a través {ph1} "
"los bytes dan 26 máscaras."

#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:374
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid ""
"These are selected results from a fresh REA analysis. The local target path "
"is shortened for display; addresses refer to REA's imported image."
msgstr ""
"Estos son resultados seleccionados de un análisis REA reciente. La ruta de "
"destino local se acorta para su visualización; las direcciones se refieren a"
" la imagen importada de REA."

#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:382
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid "One check reveals one character"
msgstr "Un cheque revela un carácter"

#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:383
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid ""
"The checker arranges the input in a 6×6 grid. A mask chooses which cells "
"contribute to a sum. Its compact encoding uses negative numbers to skip "
"cells and positive numbers to select them."
msgstr ""
"El verificador organiza la entrada en una cuadrícula de 6×6. Una máscara "
"elige qué celdas contribuyen a una suma. Su codificación compacta utiliza "
"números negativos para omitir celdas y números positivos para "
"seleccionarlos."

#. {ph0}: <a href="../../assets/figures/ctf-mask-equation.svg" >
#. {ph1}: </a >
#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:403
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid "The seventh check selects just one position. {ph0}Open figure{ph1}."
msgstr ""
"La séptima comprobación selecciona solo una posición. {ph0}Figura "
"abierta{ph1}."

#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:410
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid "Read the mask and its target from the binary"
msgstr "Lea la máscara y su objetivo desde el binario"

#. {ph0}: <code>MOVSX</code>
#. {ph1}: <code>eb</code>
#. {ph2}: <code>code[21] = 55</code>
#. {ph3}: <code>7</code>
#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:432
#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid ""
"The instruction {ph0} reads mask bytes as signed values. This is why {ph1} "
"means −21. The target is a little-endian integer. Together, these bytes tell"
" the agent that {ph2}, so that character is {ph3}."
msgstr ""
"La instrucción {ph0} lee bytes de máscara como valores firmados. Esta es la "
"razón {ph1} significa -21. El objetivo es un entero little-endian. Juntos, "
"estos bytes le dicen al agente que {ph2}, entonces ese personaje es {ph3}."

#: website/public/showcase/ctf/index.html:441
msgctxt "page:showcase/ctf/index.html"
msgid "From instructions to a readable check"
msgstr "De las instrucciones a un cheque legible"

